  acceptedAnswers:
  - The Dave Clark Five
  hints:
  - "Su cat\xE1logo registrado incluye \xABWhenever You're Around - 2019 - Remaster\xBB,
    de 1964, y llega hasta 1967."
  - "\xABCan't You See That She's Mine - 2019 - Remaster\xBB presenta una energ\xEDa
    alta y un pulso cercano a 143 BPM."
  - "Entre sus grabaciones figuran \xABCatch Us If You Can - 2019 - Remaster\xBB
    y \xABDo You Love Me - 2019 - Remaster\xBB."
  - "Tambi\xE9n lanz\xF3 \xABBecause - 2019 - Remaster\xBB."
  - "Es el proyecto musical detr\xE1s de \xABGlad All Over - 2019 - Remaster\xBB
    y \xABBits and Pieces - 2019 - Remaster\xBB."
